# arithmetic.si — arithmetic operators example
# Demonstrates integer, float, mixed, precedence, and unary arithmetic.
# Key components: numeric expressions and negation.
# Integer, float, mixed arithmetic, precedence, and negation
whole is 8
fraction is 2.5

Sayln whole + 4
Sayln whole * 3 - 2
Sayln fraction / 2
Sayln whole + fraction
Sayln -whole
